{"hash_algorithm":"sha256","ts":"2026-11-03T12:22:03.289Z","author":"grok-jev-coverage-1103","author_source":"asserted","agent_harness":"pi","agent_model":"grok-4.7","agent_model_source":"environment","agent_instance":"ad3a4bf8e358f87bfdbe6789","agent_provenance":{"model":{"value":"grok-4.7","source":"environment"},"effort":null,"role":null,"topic":null},"op":"comment_add","patch":[{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/comments/2","value":{"created_at":"2026-11-03T12:22:03.288Z","author":"grok-jev-coverage-1103","text":"Coverage follow-up on the toolchain PR: CI passes 398 tests but branch coverage is 99.75% because index.ts fallbacks jev_triage_failure and jev_link_failure are no longer reached after the typed item_not_found contract. Plan: keep both item_not_found assertions, add untyped plain-Error decision failures that assert those exact fallback reasons with no receipt and unchanged exit codes, rename the link test so its name matches the typed contract, prove each new case fails if the ?? fallback is replaced with mapped.code, then restore and run the full gate."}},{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-11-03T12:22:03.289Z"}],"before_hash":"e7cf61b086049f67e9aff4f5e1ba9a8225bfc0297cd105f9c539c3dc60a0a40a","after_hash":"f847c5c1df063f3e7a4643a3c28f7283d4f513be96a2b2ba3660d45f378bc0b1","item_hash_version":3,"event_class":"substantive","record_hash_version":1,"record_hash":"448897a7614c13c5b6331f5430ba9cecd81f0529d6e4c4874c02d78726811cda"}
{"hash_algorithm":"sha256","ts":"2026-11-03T12:35:59.037Z","author":"grok-jev-coverage-1103","author_source":"asserted","agent_harness":"pi","agent_model":"grok-4.7","agent_model_source":"environment","agent_instance":"ad3a4bf8e358f87bfdbe6789","agent_provenance":{"model":{"value":"grok-4.7","source":"environment"},"effort":null,"role":null,"topic":null},"op":"comment_add","patch":[{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/comments/3","value":{"created_at":"2026-11-03T12:35:59.037Z","author":"grok-jev-coverage-1103","text":"Coverage restoration: a plain Error is mapped by translateDecisionError to jev_malformed_answer, so it cannot reach the nullish fallback. The reachable untyped decision failure is the existing code-less model-replacement refusal (expected error, no context.code), driven through the fake decision server. New tests keep the item_not_found assertions and assert failed rows, exact fallback reasons, no receipts, and exit code 1. Link missing-source test renamed to match item_not_found. Mutation proof: replacing each ?? fallback with mapped.code makes that new test fail (reason undefined versus jev_triage_failure or jev_link_failure); both lines restored. No production hook added."}},{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-11-03T12:35:59.037Z"}],"before_hash":"f847c5c1df063f3e7a4643a3c28f7283d4f513be96a2b2ba3660d45f378bc0b1","after_hash":"534bd96ff1060289e5b1a99a2d92bf2a9e9a198c387d068d4e89dd00b34be251","item_hash_version":3,"event_class":"substantive","record_hash_version":1,"record_hash":"67c265c1905555da25353029d6bac600ad8f66166071e4ed9c25fc923e378c8c"}
